Default Damage Constants:
0C - Level 1 Magic
18 - Level 2 Magic
2A - Level 3 Magic
00 - Bio & Death
04 - Demi
14 - Drain
0A - Osmose
3C - Flare
46 - Ultima

Damage Formulas:
03 - Regular Magic (Default on all but Demi)
05 - Target Current HP (Demi), Damage = (Target Current HP) * (Damage Constant) / 16
04 - Ignore Magic Defense
0F - Special Magic
08 - Target Max HP, Damage = (Target Max HP) * (Damage Constant) / 16
17 - Multiples of 9,999, Damage = (Damage Constant) * 9999

